WEBVTT

00:02:01.070 --> 00:02:04.080
The Heart-spun Canon

00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:28.970
Why is Hino-san here?

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:37.150
Powerfully

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:38.490
More Gently

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:10.170
Huh? Tsukimori-kun?

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:15.640
I don't believe this! He went home without saying anything?!

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:22.360
Could... Could he have given me this?

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:37.300
Hello.

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:38.690
Kaho-chan?

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:39.490
Mio...

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:43.650
Where are you? We just found a great-looking cake shop!

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:45.400
How about you join us?

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:48.280
I'm sorry. I have a place I have to stop at.

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:50.630
Oh... Guess we'll have to go without you.

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:52.210
See you next time.

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:55.210
Hino-chan!

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:58.000
Hihara-sempai?

00:03:58.540 --> 00:03:59.840
Tsuchiura-kun?

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:02.970
I didn't realize how late it was!

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:06.490
Hey, isn't that a Music Department jacket?

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:07.290
Huh?

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:09.070
Why do you have that?

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:12.770
Actually, it's Tsukimori-kun's.

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:15.250
Huh? Tsukimori's?

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:49.260
This is it, huh?

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:51.570
Wow...

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:53.830
Incredible!

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:56.920
I guess he really is a rich boy, huh?

00:04:56.920 --> 00:05:00.390
Yeah, he sorta gives off that impression.

00:05:00.390 --> 00:05:02.900
What are you doing outside my house?

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:06.940
Umm, I wanted to return this to you.

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:09.590
You came here just for that?

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:11.420
I figured you'd be in trouble without it.

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:13.710
I've got another jacket, so I'd be fine.

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:16.580
Hey! Ever heard of saying "thank you"?

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.030
It's fine, Tsuchiura-kun.

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:22.830
If you're done here, would you mind leaving?

00:05:22.830 --> 00:05:24.260
Uhh, Tsukimori-kun!

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:25.990
Are you feeling better?

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:27.410
Yeah.

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:29.230
I see. That's great.

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:32.020
Just go home already-

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:36.590
U-Uh...

00:05:41.060 --> 00:05:42.870
This is fantastic!

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:45.820
You don't mind me eating all these?

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:49.570
They were gifts. I don't eat in very often.

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:53.770
Is it just you and your parents here?

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:55.610
No, my grandparents are here, too.

00:05:55.610 --> 00:05:57.340
They're all out today.

00:05:57.340 --> 00:05:58.560
I see.

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:01.120
By the way, you can really eat.

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:03.350
Indeed.

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:14.300
Oh, is this you?

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:15.950
What is it, what is it?

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:17.770
Hey!

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:19.550
Lemme see!

00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:22.200
Wow, are those your parents?

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:25.060
He's tiny, but you can tell it's him!

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:26.710
Seriously!

00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:30.490
Please don't look at that.

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:33.100
OK, then let me see your room!

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:35.320
Hihara-sempai...

00:06:35.320 --> 00:06:38.980
Even you get in a panic sometimes, huh, Tsukimori?

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:41.530
You seem pretty relaxed, considering the selection is coming up.

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:43.330
So what?

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:52.040
Are you saying that an elite Music Department student has to spend every waking second practicing?

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:54.140
That's not what I meant.

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:56.780
Since I'm in the competition, I want the best possible result.

00:06:56.780 --> 00:06:58.970
You mean winning it all?

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:03.180
Of course. What other reason is there to enter?

00:07:03.180 --> 00:07:09.630
Huh? But aren't we in the competition to enjoy music rather than worry about our ranking?

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:12.400
Yeah! They need to enjoy it more!

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:13.170
Exactly.

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:14.510
Enjoy?

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:19.690
There's another picture of Tsukimori-kun here!

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:21.740
Yeah? Where?

00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:23.410
Wow, he was so cute!

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:25.740
There are trophies, too! Awesome!

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:26.980
There are all these CDs, too!

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:29.450
I asked you not to look at my stuff!

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:30.510
Yes, sir!

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:32.980
There's some cake with my name on it!

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:39.050
Hey, if I promise to return them right away, can I borrow a few CDs?

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:42.540
That's all right, I suppose.

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:45.580
Yay! Thank you!

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:50.790
Also, I'm sorry for barging in tonight. We must be a nuisance.

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:52.790
You're still not feeling well, right?

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:54.060
I'm sorry.

00:07:54.060 --> 00:07:54.960
Huh?

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:57.840
I'm sorry about today.

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:08.770
OK, time to go home and get some dinner!

00:08:08.770 --> 00:08:10.520
You're going to eat more?

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:12.200
There's always room for dinner!

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:13.250
So?

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:14.200
Huh?

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:17.680
Why did you have Tsukimori's uniform?

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:23.220
Well, umm...

00:08:23.220 --> 00:08:25.910
He was running away and then he got a fever, and then he fell asleep, and then-

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:27.320
You're not making any sense!

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:29.740
It's no big deal.

00:08:31.230 --> 00:08:34.230
We have to do our best in the second selection, huh?

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:35.770
Huh?

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:39.450
Tsukimori-kun's taking it so seriously.

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:43.070
I can't be slacking off in General Studies, either.

00:08:43.070 --> 00:08:45.990
Are you sure it's not just his natural attitude towards things?

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:47.260
He really hates to lose.

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:50.950
You seem the same way, though.

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:51.900
Hey!

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:53.570
Don't group me in with him!

00:08:53.570 --> 00:08:54.470
Sorry, sorry.

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:57.010
Hey! You two are too slow!

00:08:58.530 --> 00:08:59.480
Coming!

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:10.530
The theme of the second selection is "Something to Believe In."

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:13.760
I need to hurry and pick a piece so I can start practicing!

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:16.670
I need to look for an accompanist, too.

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:19.480
Geez...

00:09:24.010 --> 00:09:25.030
Kaho-chan!

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:26.430
Kaho-chan!

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:28.400
Kaho-chan!

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:31.520
Mio... Don't startle me like that.

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:34.090
I called your name a bunch of times.

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:37.450
Y-Yeah? Sorry about that.

00:09:40.610 --> 00:09:42.740
It was a ton of fun.

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:44.210
Yeah?

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:46.590
Why don't you go check it out too, Kaho-chan?

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:48.320
Kaho-chan!

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:51.170
Huh? Sorry, what is it?

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:54.570
Kaho, could you at least take a break from the CDs during lunch?

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:56.990
Y-Yeah...

00:10:00.850 --> 00:10:03.410
Kaho-chan, you think we can walk home together today?

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:04.670
Huh?

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:07.230
Sorry, I have to practice again today.

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:10.370
Aww... Why don't you take a break sometime?

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:12.810
We haven't been able to talk much lately.

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:15.990
It can't be helped. Kaho's really busy lately.

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:16.760
Yeah...

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.230
Anyway, see you later.

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:30.510
No, this piece isn't the right fit either...

00:10:30.510 --> 00:10:33.400
What am I gonna do about the selection?

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:36.340
Kaho-chan, you're done practicing already?

00:10:36.340 --> 00:10:38.500
Let's go to the cake shop!

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:41.140
Sorry, I'm not done yet.

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:43.950
Kaho-chan, it's not good to overdo it.

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:44.630
But...

00:10:44.630 --> 00:10:47.720
You've been looking so tired lately.

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:50.450
The best thing at a time like that is something sweet!

00:10:50.450 --> 00:10:53.430
If you go eat some tasty cake and have a nice fun chat,

00:10:53.430 --> 00:10:55.040
you'll get all your energy back!

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:56.810
I told you, I don't have time for that!

00:10:56.810 --> 00:10:57.820
Kaho-chan...

00:10:57.820 --> 00:11:00.800
Kaho, it's not good to work yourself so hard.

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:03.650
But, I have to choose a song to perform,

00:11:03.650 --> 00:11:05.710
and I need to find an accompanist.

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:06.730
I'm running out of time!

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:07.920
Kaho...

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:10.600
Well, aren't you taking a break right now?

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:11.840
Y-Yeah...

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:14.970
Then let me hold your violin for a second.

00:11:14.970 --> 00:11:16.830
Don't touch it!

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:18.300
Kaho-chan...

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:20.770
You don't need to be so tense!

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:25.250
Please, stop disrupting my practice time!

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:26.910
Disrupting?

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:30.160
Mio was worried about you because you're working too hard!

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:34.690
Neither you nor Mio understand how much work goes into preparing for the competition!

00:11:36.060 --> 00:11:39.620
Fine. We won't invite you out anymore.

00:11:39.620 --> 00:11:41.000
Let's go, Mio.

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:06.540
I couldn't figure out a song to play.

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:12.990
I need to choose one so I can start practicing.

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:31.200
It won't play?

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:33.740
No way...

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:36.730
Happy birthday!

00:12:38.910 --> 00:12:41.410
Thank you! It's so cute.

00:12:41.410 --> 00:12:42.570
It's a music box?

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:44.140
Open it up!

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:48.850
This song...

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:52.780
Yup. It's the one that played in that movie we saw together.

00:12:52.780 --> 00:12:54.820
You really liked it, didn't you?

00:12:54.820 --> 00:12:58.750
Yeah! Thank you, Mio, Nao!

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:03.200
What should I do? This was a present from Mio and Nao...

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:28.060
Mio, let's go eat in the square in the woods.

00:13:28.060 --> 00:13:29.260
OK.

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:55.020
Not getting along with Mio and Nao makes me feel so lonely...

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:13.210
What're you up to, Hino-chan?

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:17.410
Hino-chan?

00:14:19.390 --> 00:14:23.300
Oh, I see. The music box is broken, huh?

00:14:25.220 --> 00:14:27.120
What's wrong, Hino-chan?

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:33.830
I'm sorry. That was a birthday present from my friends.

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:36.840
All I've been doing is practicing lately,

00:14:36.840 --> 00:14:39.040
so I feel like we're moving apart...

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:40.420
I see.

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:42.810
It's fine, Hino-chan!

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:47.280
There's nothing that can't be repaired after being broken!

00:14:48.290 --> 00:14:50.200
Let's see...

00:14:51.420 --> 00:14:52.860
Hihara-sempai...

00:14:52.860 --> 00:14:54.580
Can I take it apart?

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:55.420
S-Sure.

00:15:03.080 --> 00:15:04.340
It works!

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:05.780
You fixed it?

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:09.200
A piece broke off from the lid and got jammed in there.

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:14.190
Here you go, Hino-chan.

00:15:14.190 --> 00:15:16.850
Thank you so much, Hihara-sempai!

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:19.300
Pachelbel's Canon, huh?

00:15:23.430 --> 00:15:26.560
Hino-san, do you have some time after school today?

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:29.310
I have a favor I need to ask of you.

00:15:30.730 --> 00:15:33.610
It has to do with the competition.

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:34.600
Is that OK?

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:36.440
Sure...

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:40.170
Please meet me at the front gate, OK?

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:41.500
OK.

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:49.070
Wow, Hino-san! Yunoki-sempai came and talked to you!

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:50.710
I'm so jealous!

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:54.380
You're really so lucky!

00:15:54.380 --> 00:15:57.400
I want him to talk to me, too!

00:15:57.400 --> 00:16:00.310
Yeah, me too! Me too!

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:01.730
I envy you!

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:03.130
She's so lucky!

00:16:03.130 --> 00:16:03.800
Right?

00:16:03.800 --> 00:16:04.760
Yeah, yeah.

00:16:05.570 --> 00:16:07.760
The music box is fixed,

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:10.470
but will I be able to repair our relationship?

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:16.830
Is this the... favor?

00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:23.400
Survey

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:18.830
It's actually for school council.

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:21.500
Since the school-wide Competition is a school-sanctioned event,

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:24.650
we wanted to make it a little more exciting.

00:16:24.650 --> 00:16:28.890
But, we aren't sure how the student body will react.

00:16:28.890 --> 00:16:30.860
I-I see.

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:35.170
So we thought taking a survey would be a good idea.

00:16:35.170 --> 00:16:38.580
You're on student council, Yunoki-sempai?

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:43.850
No, but I wanted to do something to help.

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:47.320
Did you hear that? That's our Yunoki-sama.

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:49.350
He's such a wonderful person.

00:16:49.350 --> 00:16:51.180
He truly is.

00:16:51.180 --> 00:16:53.990
That outfit looks pretty cute on you, too.

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:54.530
What?!

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:54.990
No way!

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:57.600
There's no way this is cute!

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:00.960
Well, shall we get started?

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:03.070
Please fill out our survey.

00:17:03.980 --> 00:17:05.580
Please!

00:17:06.760 --> 00:17:09.040
Please fill out our survey!

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:13.000
What are you doing?

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:15.510
What is this?

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.140
A survey?

00:17:18.580 --> 00:17:20.700
Please help us!

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:21.930
Why me?

00:17:22.410 --> 00:17:25.130
Thank you. You're a great help, Tsukimori-kun.

00:17:25.130 --> 00:17:25.950
Huh?

00:17:26.740 --> 00:17:27.640
Huh?

00:17:28.510 --> 00:17:30.100
What are you doing?

00:17:30.840 --> 00:17:32.070
Oh, Sempai...

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:36.730
We could use your help by filling out this survey!

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:38.030
Thank you.

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:41.990
Hihara-sempai and Yunoki-sempai are both really good at this, but...

00:17:42.280 --> 00:17:44.490
Sh-Should I write it in here?

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:45.360
Yeah.

00:17:45.360 --> 00:17:47.040
He's kinda scary.

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:50.970
These two look like they're about to kill someone.

00:17:52.190 --> 00:17:53.820
Hey, you two,

00:17:53.820 --> 00:17:55.930
do you think you can be a little more sociable?

00:17:55.930 --> 00:17:57.660
Like those two.

00:17:57.660 --> 00:18:00.450
Thank you. Get home safe.

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:03.130
All right. Thank you! You've been a great help!

00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:06.500
Thank you. Get home safe.

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:08.810
All right. Thank you! You've been a great help!

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:09.650
No friggin' way!

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:09.650
No friggin' way!

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:16.690
Please fill...

00:18:16.690 --> 00:18:17.840
Huh?

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:19.300
Your cooperation is appreciated.

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:24.330
Those two, as well.

00:18:25.360 --> 00:18:27.460
Please fill out this survey!

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:28.590
Survey?

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:31.580
We have to fill that whole thing out?

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:34.100
We don't even care about the competition.

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:36.310
The General Studies student finished dead last, right?

00:18:36.730 --> 00:18:38.940
It's an embarrassment to the entire department.

00:18:38.940 --> 00:18:40.630
Seriously. How stupid.

00:18:40.630 --> 00:18:43.420
Hey! Where do you get off?!

00:18:45.090 --> 00:18:50.130
Why don't you write down exactly why you're not interested and why it's stupid on the survey?!

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:53.810
Kaho-chan is working really hard at this! She takes it very seriously!

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:56.280
Nao! Mio!

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:58.990
What part of that is embarrassing exactly?!

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:00.900
Wh-What the...

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:02.870
Yeah! She's working really hard.

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:06.270
I also think her performance was great.

00:19:06.270 --> 00:19:10.000
Us music students don't particularly care for the attitude you General Studies kids have.

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:13.280
Hey! Not all General Studies students are like that!

00:19:13.280 --> 00:19:16.410
When I heard the first selection, I thought she was pretty good!

00:19:16.410 --> 00:19:17.810
Yeah? Really?

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:21.590
Lots of people are looking forward to the next selection.

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:23.200
Yeah, yeah!

00:19:23.840 --> 00:19:25.470
That's great.

00:19:30.780 --> 00:19:32.760
Mio... Nao...

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:39.840
I'm sorry. And also... thank you.

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:42.770
I'm sorry, too.

00:19:42.770 --> 00:19:44.510
Kaho-chan...

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:47.980
I've made up my mind.

00:19:47.980 --> 00:19:49.030
Huh?

00:19:49.890 --> 00:19:53.420
I'm going to play "Canon" in the second selection.

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:55.510
The song from the music box?

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:56.230
Yeah.

00:19:56.230 --> 00:19:59.270
I can't wait for your performance!

00:19:59.270 --> 00:20:00.690
We'll cheer you on.

00:20:01.070 --> 00:20:02.160
Thanks!

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:14.950
I want to play it... I want to play Canon!

00:20:14.950 --> 00:20:17.670
Hey, did you heard about the second selection?

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:20.310
They said Tsukimori's parents are coming.

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:23.740
Tsukimori always gets special treatment.

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:26.780
He won the first selection by a landslide.

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:29.250
He's the clear favorite to win the whole thing.

00:20:30.810 --> 00:20:32.670
What are you looking at?

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:35.210
Huh? Isn't that the General Studies participant?

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:38.710
Are you interested because we're talking about Tsukimori?

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:42.380
Could it be that you're in love with him?

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:43.870
Pardon?!

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:45.680
What do you see in that guy?

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:47.600
His personality is totally messed up.

00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:50.310
Not as messed up as you guys.

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:51.680
What did you say?!

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:58.570
Could you not block the hallway? You're in my way.

00:20:59.050 --> 00:21:00.780
Tsukimori-kun...

00:21:02.550 --> 00:21:06.470
Also, my parents have nothing to do with the competition.

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:09.530
Talking about me is nothing but a nuisance.

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:10.940
Get out of here.

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:16.110
I said move.

00:21:24.440 --> 00:21:28.480
You shouldn't get involved with those guys, Hino-san.

00:21:29.000 --> 00:21:30.320
Thank you.

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:32.920
Did you come here to rescue me?

00:21:32.920 --> 00:21:36.090
It's not that. It's because I'm used to it.

00:21:36.090 --> 00:21:37.100
Used to it?

00:21:37.620 --> 00:21:40.500
Tsukimori-kun, you seem a little off lately.

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:44.280
You've been ill and you seem to be in a bit of a panic...

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:49.440
Could it be because of the pressure of taking first place in the first selection?

00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:51.000
It's not that at all.

00:21:51.890 --> 00:21:55.450
Or maybe... You're nervous because your parents are coming?

00:21:58.130 --> 00:22:01.620
No way! Did I just... step on a land mine?

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:39.760
Lili's One Point Classic!

00:23:36.620 --> 00:23:39.750
Lili's One Point Classic

00:23:40.370 --> 00:23:47.630
A canon is a style of music where the same melody is performed at various starting points.

00:23:47.630 --> 00:23:50.250
It's also called a "tsuisoukyoku" or "Chasing Tune".

00:23:50.250 --> 00:23:54.450
In other words, a round is a type of canon.

00:23:54.450 --> 00:23:56.310
OK, now time for a quiz.

00:23:56.310 --> 00:24:00.020
A canon is a "tsuisoukyoku" and a concerto is a "kyousoukyoku"...

00:24:00.020 --> 00:24:02.980
So what's an etude called?

00:24:02.980 --> 00:24:04.800
The answer is at the end of this program!

00:24:05.110 --> 00:24:10.660
Next Episode

00:24:05.530 --> 00:24:07.310
It's almost the second selection!

00:24:07.310 --> 00:24:09.120
Just the thought of it makes me nervous!

00:24:09.120 --> 00:24:11.740
There's a good technique for keeping your composure on stage.

00:24:11.740 --> 00:24:15.890
Aren't girls more worried about their complexion than their composure?

00:24:15.890 --> 00:24:17.940
Next episode: A Peaceful Concerto.

00:24:17.940 --> 00:24:20.090
Huh? Shimizu-kun?

00:24:20.540 --> 00:24:21.980
The answer is...

00:24:22.740 --> 00:24:25.090
"Renshuukyoku"! (Study Piece)
